540: ## 11. Release Process
541: 
542: 1. From dev: `git checkout -b release/vX.Y.Z`; bump the version in ALL THREE carriers —
543:    `package.json`, `dsh-plugin.json`, `dsh-distribution.json` (`verify:manifest` reddens on any
544:    mismatch) — plus the changelog note.
545: 2. Full gate sweep, each command named exactly: `bun run verify:vendor` (after the wave's single `node
546:    scripts/repin-vendor.ts --write --i-know-this-is-the-captains-step` re-pin when `skills/**` changed),
547:    `bun test packages` (a repo-root `bun test` also scans the historical `evidence/**` fixtures and
548:    reddens on them), `bun run typecheck`, `bun run test:qa`, `bun run verify:docs`, `bun run verify:rows`,
549:    `node skills/dsh-qa/scripts/preset-conformance.ts --self-test`, `node scripts/verify-dist-fresh.ts`,
550:    `node scripts/verify-pack-closure.ts` (freshness read from the `expected-after-pack` list at the
551:    re-pack, never from its exit code — §4's bound), plus the real smoke cases (`dual-track-smoke`,
552:    `mcp-call`). `bun run verify:gates` covers the nine static members (vendor, dist freshness, row
553:    parity, doc pairs, preset conformance, plugin manifest, comment coverage, graph model, workflows).
554:    `node scripts/verify-no-host-override.ts` is NOT a member of that aggregate and is REQUIRED for EVERY
555:    release sweep; `node scripts/verify-manual-paths.ts` is REQUIRED whenever `AGENTS.md` changed.
